This distribution contains vibelore source, documentation, and regression fixtures.
Private manuscripts and development archives are excluded from the source tree.

InkOS (https://github.com/Narcooo/inkos) informed earlier compatibility and
workflow research. The historical genre-frontmatter word lists were replaced
with vibelore-authored repetition cues and the StoryState hook schema was
redefined in vibelore terms. Genre identifiers are retained for compatibility. See docs/PROVENANCE.md for the scope of this reference.

Node.js, MCP hosts, and optional model servers are separate products with their
own terms. This distribution does not include their binaries or libraries.
